{
  "title": "Albuminuria-dependent urine concentrating index calibration: small, uncertain predictive gains across NHANES cycles",
  "abstract": "In NHANES2009\u201310 source and2011\u201312 external-cycle adults (n=5362/4584), ACR\u226530mg/g-by-logUCI spline interactions reduced weighted osmolality MSE by 78.628(mOsm/kg)\u00b2 (0.357%), but the source-refit/target-PSU bootstrap95% interval [-79.012,290.343] crossed zero. Added predictive value was not established.",
